# Prebuilt toolchain assets ledger (release tag: toolchain-v1, immutable).
#
# Format: one sha256sum line per asset (<sha256>  <asset-name>); the asset
# names are flat (no directories). scripts/ci/fetch-toolchain-assets.sh
# refuses to run when this file is missing, empty or has no entry for the
# requested triple -- an empty ledger must never fail open.
#
# Expected asset families per triple:
#   corocc-toolchain-<triple>-gcc<ver>-glibc<ver>.tar.gz   (top level: corocc-toolchain/<triple>/...)
#   corocc-sysroot-<triple>-glibc<ver>.tar.gz              (top level: corocc-sysroot/<triple>/...)
# aarch64_be/armeb/riscv32 carry both; sysroot-only is allowed and detected
# from the asset name.
#
# Asset inventory (6 assets; sha256sum natural order). For a full-chain triple
# the sysroot line precedes the toolchain line: the fetch probe asserts
# <opt>/corocc-sysroot/<triple>/usr/include/stdio.h after every unpack.
#
c180c00cdcbbd76b522551163e57fde575628c1ad81e96a075d54d0dd74e198b  corocc-sysroot-aarch64_be-linux-gnu-glibc2.39.tar.gz
